msgstr "Ladda ner plugin-programmet Free Tools"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:78
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:82
msgid "Easy setup in just a few steps"
msgstr "Enkel installation i bara några steg"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:92
msgid ""
"The plugin integrates seamlessly using WordPress hooks - no modifications to "
"core files required."
msgstr ""
"Pluginet integreras smidigt med hjälp av WordPress-hooks – inga ändringar i "
"kärnfilerna krävs."

